# 只把构建用的东西送进 daemon，其余全部排除，避免 20MB wasm 之外的杂项拖慢构建
.git
.gitignore
.github

# 与镜像无关的目录
gopeed-push/
gopeed-patched/local-patches.patch
gopeed-patched/README.md
gopeed-web/*.go
gopeed-web/go.mod
gopeed-web/go.sum
gopeed-web/README.md
gopeed-web/caddy-gopeed.conf

# 但要用到 gopeed-web/web 下的构建产物，重新放行
!gopeed-web/web
!gopeed-web/web/**

# 后端源码里的构建垃圾
gopeed-patched/gd/.git
gopeed-patched/gd/dist
gopeed-patched/gd/bin
gopeed-patched/gd/storage
gopeed-patched/gd/Downloads
gopeed-patched/gd/cmd/web/dist
gopeed-patched/gd/ui
gopeed-patched/gd/_docs
gopeed-patched/gd/_examples
**/*.data
**/*.log
**/*.exe

# 交付文件本身不进构建上下文
# 注意：docker/ 必须留在上下文里，Dockerfile 要 COPY docker/config.json 等三份文件
docker-compose.yml
docker-compose.nas.yaml
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
README.md
LICENSE
